WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:30.440
Daram Zuba and Rukuku Kil's attacks
put the Ideon in danger.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:35.730
Although Lou and Sheryl were
 badly hurt on board the Ideon,

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:40.440
the Ideon's Wave Leader Gun managed
to break through even the Freezer attack.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:02.350
And the one who put an end to
Cosmo and Daram's duel on Earth...

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.010
Was none other than Gije Zaral.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.320
Gije!

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.170
Stop it, Karala!

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:15.080
Gije, unable to atone for his crimes, could only cry.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:21.270
<b>Home Aflame</b>

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:35.420
No, you can't talk.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:36.420
But...

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.550
There's no harm in having a discussion with him.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.760
But Gije isn't a member of this crew.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.900
He's not a prisoner either.

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:46.930
Hey! The Solo Ship's going to land soon!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.010
Really?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.670
You'd better not run away!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.180
I have no reason to.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.570
Where are we landing?

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.970
There's a base about ten kilometers north.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.520
What's this all of a sudden, Bes?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.830
Well, they suddenly gave us permission to land.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.370
We should use Gloria again.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.990
It doesn't seem like we'll get the chance.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.760
They want the person in charge to come down.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.280
Did they give a name?

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.380
Jordan Bes, alone.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.390
That's strange.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.320
I'm not so sure about this...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.230
Cosmo, come with me.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.590
Taking a kid along shouldn't be an issue.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.120
Well, I admit I'm not an adult...

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.040
Let's go.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.200
Be careful!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.780
Thanks.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.280
What's this?!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.590
We called for Jordan Bes alone. You wait here.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:00.320
Bes!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.680
There's no other way.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.930
Hey, let go of me!

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.560
You've done well to hold out
 this long with a single ship.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.890
Consider yourself a hero to your homeland.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.580
Thank you very much.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.110
We'll take over things from here.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.570
The Solo Ship and the Ideon will be
 handed over to the Earth Union.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.520
The Solo Ship and the Ideon won't
be able to function without us.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.860
What nonsense!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.360
You insult me.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.640
Is that so? Well, never mind.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.340
By the way, you have a father who
 served in the military, right?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.970
We could let you meet your family.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.050
And if you hand over the Solo Ship,

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.790
we may consider promoting you to a Staff Officer.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.710
So that's what this was about...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.690
How'd it go, Bes?

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.690
They're people who reject the
 colonies and refuse to leave Earth.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.140
Their methods are crafty.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.520
What do you mean?

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.570
What is it?!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.690
That's the way Earth does things.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:20.460
There doesn't seem to be anything particularly useful.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.090
What's that?

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.380
Seems like a private message addressed to Lady Harulu.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.380
Oh?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:29.890
This may reveal the connection between
 the Orme Foundation and the Doba family.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.730
Is there really such a thing?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.820
Don't reveal this to anyone.
 I'll keep it until we've returned home.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.590
Of course.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.900
When will the Abzonol arrive?

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.210
In approximately an hour.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.790
A plan to drain them of their power...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.020
This time...

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.040
Why haven't we heard from Bes and Cosmo?

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.750
What if the Earth Union captured or killed them?!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.840
You can still hear their point signals, right?

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.640
Yes.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.990
They haven't left the building.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.340
This is Bes' homeland.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.270
Karala, he may have ditched you!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.170
No way.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.380
Kasha! Bes isn't that kind of person.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:19.840
That's right.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.350
Bes!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.110
Let's stop our point signal transmitters.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.310
That will get the attention of the Solo Ship.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:32.300
No, wait.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.480
I'll try to convince them one more time.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.990
Bes, you say?!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:38.890
That's right!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.620
Your son has turned against the military!

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.840
Impossible! Bes would never do that!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.840
That's what I'd like to believe, too.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.960
I didn't raise my son to soil the Jordan family name!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.010
But if he continues to behave this way,

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.590
his prestige will be completely diminished.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.180
It can't be...

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.560
Bes would never...

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.690
Bes was assigned to Planet Solo because
 he was an excellent cadet...

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.970
Will you try to persuade your son?

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.150
Bes is here?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.570
You must persuade him to follow military orders.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.020
Of course, Sir!

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:12.860
Hey!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:13.820
Let us out of here!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:14.990
There's something I need to say!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:15.870
Let me...

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:16.660
Shut up!

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.480
There's someone we want you to meet first.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.110
It's them!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.290
What happened? Bes!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.970
Bes, Bes! Can you hear me?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:29.460
Bes!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.960
Bes! You're here, aren't you! Bes!

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.920
Is that your father and mother?

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.260
This is all part of their scheme!

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:40.270
You can hear us, Bes!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.280
We know that you are in prison for treason!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.310
That's not right!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.360
I'm innocent! I haven't done anything wrong!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.280
He's there, dear! Bes is in there!

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.780
Is that true, Bes?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.420
Do you think I would stain the
 reputation of the Jordan family?!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.550
That's true! That's true!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.330
Bes, you wouldn't do that.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.540
Bes! Look over here!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.530
Show us your face!

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:05.950
No, I can't.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.170
You can't face us?!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.100
You can't even face me?!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.180
Shall we open the door?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.870
Go ahead and try! I'll just bite my tongue and die!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:21.840
But you have to follow ordersright now! Open this up!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.350
Bes! Bes!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.830
Would it hurt to show us your face one more time?!

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.400
If we talk it over, we'll understand.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.310
Ermi, that's enough! Let's go!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.960
Good grief...

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.190
Bes, are you fine with this?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.420
If I were to succumb to my own feelings...

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.950
That'd only be egoism.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:47.270
While I'm caught up in trivial matters,
 the power of the Ide is getting stronger.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.660
What if it destroys my parents as well?

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.620
Egoism is no "altruistic power".

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.160
That's why I have to abandon my family.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.840
Wouldn't you do the same thing, Cosmo?

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.220
Your parents will be saved that way.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.460
That's what I'd like to think.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.400
How about we shut off our point
 signals in about thirty minutes?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:08.840
Yeah.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.430
All units!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.720
Once the Adigo squad has drawn out the Giant,

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.210
The Heavy Mobile Mecha Abzonol will capture it.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.680
After that, we'll launch aconcentrated attack at once!

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:50.710
Signs of the enemy detected!

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:52.390
They're approaching from the northern line!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.650
There's no response from Bes!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.440
What do we do?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.600
Hatari, pay attention to the Earth Union's movements.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.900
It's possible that they'll use this
 opportunity to seize the Solo Ship!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.620
I know!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.220
All hands! Watch out for movement on the ground!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.330
Joliver!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.860
Solo Ship! Normal engine, start!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.130
Roger!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:16.760
Deck!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.560
I'll let you handle the missiles.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.880
Alright, let's dock right away!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:46.530
Bes and Cosmo's point signals
 changed into distress signals!

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.370
Distress signals?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.540
Hatari, can't we help them out?

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.020
I don't know the enemy's numbers!

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:55.460
It's possible if the Ideon can hold out on its own.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.580
They have a considerable number
of fighters, don't they?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:02.000
They're coming from behind too!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.860
Portside! Anti-aircraft fire, quickly!

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:10.920
If he's locked up in there, I've got to go out and help!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.350
Karala!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.730
In this condition, we can't help Bes and Cosmo!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.810
Rear side, you're short on missiles!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.490
Is it the Buff Clan?

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:46.480
Yeah.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:48.810
I can't believe they're still after us.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.010
Looks like they are constantly getting resupplied.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.180
To see the manifestation of the Ide...

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.720
You have to stay aboard this ship.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:17.040
And in order to do that, you
 have to show the Solo Ship...

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.450
that you're a valuable person.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.870
If they let me, I certainly will!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.810
The others are giving their all to defend
themselves from the attack above.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.780
I'm leaving the ship to rescue Bes and Cosmo.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:34.850
I want you to help.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.590
I'll help you.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:42.310
But... Can you really trust me, Lady Karala?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.700
I trust those tears of yours.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:46.660
Lady Karala...

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.920
There are no ranks here. Please drop the formalities.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:50.990
Come on!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.280
Yes!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:15.890
Are those the aliens Bes brought here?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:20.140
He has shamed the entire Jordan family!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.860
And he entered the military with
such an excellent record...

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.280
He should die! As a soldier, he
 should choose death over dishonor!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.270
Let's try to persuade him again!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.650
Bes is our son.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.620
I'm sure he'll come to his senses.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.740
Wasn't he always loyal to his parents?

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.620
That's right...

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:38.580
He was a good boy.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.490
A good boy!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.970
Gije, are you alright?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.810
I'm not sure how this works, but I'll give it a shot!

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.670
What? Karala and Gije are running away?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.480
They're escaping! I'll shoot them!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:10.040
No, hold your fire! 
Protecting the Solo Ship comes first!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.620
Are they inside that building?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:19.370
Yes.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:21.520
Please be careful with that handgun.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:22.530
Yes.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.860
The Abzonol is launching, are you ready?

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.170
Pin it down as planned.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.470
They're coming from the right!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:41.680
In front!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.450
What's wrong? The power is dropping fast!

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.830
Kasha, raise the output!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.640
The Ideon should have more power than this!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.820
Raise it!

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:15.970
You're right, but...

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.310
Just as I thought...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.700
Naturally, there's a limit to the amount
 of power the Giant can output!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.380
But how?

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.200
This is the latest Anti-Giant weapon!

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.900
It can absorb all the energy released by the Giant...

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.650
They won't be able to move.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.960
Why isn't the Ideon moving?!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.200
Is there a limit to the Ide's power?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.180
Damn!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.700
Okay, have the Abzonol transport the Giant!

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.440
They're taking away the Ideon!

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.540
Can't you contact Kasha or the others?

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.200
It's impossible! The communications aren't working!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:34.000
I found them! 470 meters to the right...

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:36.960
No, about 250 meters!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.720
Can anyone hear me? The Ideon gauge is still lit!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.030
Deck! Can you contact the others? I can't hear anything!

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.140
Hey, why isn't the normal power going up?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.450
Move! Move! Move!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:04.000
This is the Solo Ship, respond! Kasha, Deck, Moera!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.290
The distress signal from Bes has disappeared.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.050
Who's there?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:17.050
Gije! Don't kill anyone.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.500
I didn't hit their vital areas.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.010
Did the Air Force call us?

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:24.230
Well, the situation with the Solo Ship.... Huh?

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.150
Who are you people?

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.010
You ungrateful brat!

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.950
We're no longer parent and child!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.350
Please think it over again, Bes!

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:42.870
This isn't getting anywhere!

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.600
Are those Bes' parents?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:47.620
We've got to move to the shelter.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.020
Bes' parents are...

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:50.420
I understand.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:54.240
I feel so bad about this...

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:55.850
His mother?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.670
Get out of here now, or you'll
 be caught up in the air raid!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.050
Dear!

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:03.010
What?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:04.000
Please hurry.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.890
You two must be good people!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.050
Please get away from here!

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:09.690
Are you Bes' companions?

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.390
If so, don't get Bes involved in anything evil!

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:13.540
Silence!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.240
Dear!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.160
Please step back!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.220
If you don't, I will shoot you.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.740
Please don't send Bes down the wrong path!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:29.670
Karala!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.280
Bes!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.030
Gije! You're here too?

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.760
Gije?!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.770
Yes! He gave me a hand.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.510
It was my own decision to bring him here.

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.100
I knocked out some soldiers. We need to hurry.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.850
I'm sorry that I doubted you before.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.050
No, it couldn't be helped.

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:54.360
I'm not saying that you have to forget
your hatred towards me.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.440
Same here. But I'm happy that you came.

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.400
My apologies.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.620
Let's go, Karala!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:00.390
Yes!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.110
I only want to see the power of the Ide.

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:03.830
That's all.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:06.650
If it weren't for Lady Karala, I wouldn't
have come to help you.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:08.840
That's the way people are!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.160
Did you see that, dear?

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.420
Come on, the soldiers have awoken.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:21.180
We shouldn't get involved.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.160
But Bes...

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.220
The gauge shows the power is going up!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:30.480
Kasha! Let's move out! The Ideon can still move!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.140
We can do it! Get ready!

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.520
Fire all missiles!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:44.020
What?! The Giant's power has increased again?

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.520
That won't stop us!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.580
The Ide's power is going up, Hatari!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.480
We can beat them if we work together with the Ideon!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.670
Our bombardment is too weak!

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:03.210
Don't let the Giant and that ship get any closer!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.190
The energy's been restored!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.740
The Giant has regained its energy! Lady Rukuku!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:41.800
I don't care!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.510
Keep absorbing the power...

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.170
It shouldn't be able to last much more!

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.300
The light is getting intense!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.370
Such amazing energy...

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.990
It exceeded the absorption ability of our machine...

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.660
It's an unlimited, infinite power!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:44.340
Are we seeing a bad dream?

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:46.480
<i><i>Parting with you would surely be easy</i></i>

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:46.510
A dream...

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:53.540
<i><i>I don't want the days to wear you down</i></i>

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.540
This is a nightmare...

00:21:53.830 --> 00:22:00.110
<i><i>I suddenly gave you my kindness</i></i>

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:06.260
<i><i>to heal the the dry skin parched by tears</i></i>

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:13.010
<i><i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i></i>

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:19.600
<i><i>I'll send a prayer your way</i></i>

